    {
      "id": "claim_b99b3c88fd494f1a8fb4dbd9b65cd62a",
      "statement": "The repository has three runtime surfaces that matter before most changes: the FastAPI backend monolith mounts domain endpoints and shared HTTP routers from `apps/backend/app/main.py` and `apps/backend/app/registry.py`; the frontend keeps a contract-level domain registry in `apps/frontend/lib/domains.ts` that drives navigation, `/d/[domain]` routing, and backend endpoint selection; and the MCP server is a separate FastMCP app under `apps/mcp/mcp_app/main.py` that reuses backend business seams such as the shared domain catalog and tenancy/knowledge surfaces.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://README.md#L98-L115",
